      "id": 4784,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The researcher reported an issue where in certain cases product imports would send notification emails with full MySQL error messages. In this case, the error reported was caused by a timeout unrelated to the file uploaded by the researcher and didn't contain any sensitive information. The issue has been fixed and notification emails no longer show full MySQL error messages.",
